     "<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">\r\nHi Romina,\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>From your output, I see that you ran codex with 5 samples from the 1000 GP. The largest K that can be set here is 5 (the number of latent factors estimated by codex, which can not exceed the number of the samples or the number of exons). This\r\n is why you got an error when K=6.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Also, to gain better performance, I would suggest at least 20-30 samples to be processed together. We’ve analyzed bam file from different batches so it’s not required that they come from a homogeneous sample pool.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Hope that this helps,</div>\r\n<div>Yuchao</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n<div>\r\n<blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n<div><br></div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11.1999998092651px;line-height:14.5599994659424px\">Hi Yuchao,</span><br>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div><font face=\"Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11.1999998092651px;line-height:14.5599994659424px\"><br>\r\n</span></font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11.1999998092651px;line-height:14.5599994659424px\">I&#39;m a research fellow at CNR in Pisa and I&#39;m interested in using your tool for CNV identification in\r\n a subset of bam from 1000 GP.</span></font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11.1999998092651px;line-height:14.5599994659424px\">I have different length of reads and I know from you paper that CODEX works better with homogeneous\r\n files so I splitted my bam dataset according to the length and I submitted them to the tool separately. I had errors with two of them. Could you please tell me how can I fix it?</span></font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11.1999998092651px;line-height:14.5599994659424px\"><br>\r\n</span></font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11.1999998092651px;line-height:14.5599994659424px\">Please find </span></font><span style=\"font-size:11.1999998092651px;line-height:14.5599994659424px;font-family:Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">attached\r\n the logs, I hope thay cam help you to figure out what is going on.</span></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11.1999998092651px;line-height:14.5599994659424px\"><br>\r\n</span></font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11.1999998092651px;line-height:14.5599994659424px\">Thanks in advance.</span></font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11.1999998092651px;line-height:14.5599994659424px\"><br>\r\n</span></font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11.1999998092651px;line-height:14.5599994659424px\">My best,</span></font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11.1999998092651px;line-height:14.5599994659424px\">Romina</span></font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11.1999998092651px;line-height:14.5599994659424px\"><br>\r\n</span></font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11.1999998092651px;line-height:14.5599994659424px\"><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</span></font></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11.1999998092651px;line-height:14.5599994659424px\"><br>\r\